// REQUIRES: gpu
// Systems on the GPU (docs/gpu.md): a program prints the same built with
// --gpu as without, and with --parallel as well.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_mix.ent > %t.cpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_mix.ent --gpu > %t.gpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_mix.ent --gpu --parallel > %t.gpupar
// RUN: diff %t.cpu %t.gpu
// RUN: diff %t.cpu %t.gpupar
// RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MIX --input-file=%t.gpu
// MIX: frame 10 moved 10 total 1293685.463344 hot 540
// MIX: frame 20 moved 20 total 1281302.013828 hot 1512
// MIX: frame 30 moved 30 total 1226484.675752 hot 2592

// Whole numbers sent to other entities and accumulated into uniques, many
// at once into the same few: combined atomically on the GPU, the same.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_sends.ent > %t.sends.cpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_sends.ent --gpu > %t.sends.gpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_sends.ent --gpu --parallel > %t.sends.gpupar
// RUN: diff %t.sends.cpu %t.sends.gpu
// RUN: diff %t.sends.cpu %t.sends.gpupar
// RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SENDS --input-file=%t.sends.gpu
// SENDS: frame 20 hits 665841 strongest 995 weakest 1 total -840697920

// Fractions' least and greatest accumulated into uniques: combined on
// the GPU by their bits in their order, the same, -0.0 below 0.0.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_extremes.ent > %t.extremes.cpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_extremes.ent --gpu > %t.extremes.gpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_extremes.ent --gpu --parallel > %t.extremes.gpupar
// RUN: diff %t.extremes.cpu %t.extremes.gpu
// RUN: diff %t.extremes.cpu %t.extremes.gpupar
// RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=EXTREMES --input-file=%t.extremes.gpu
// EXTREMES: frame 0: -99.999725 99.999466 -1.999995 0.999998 5.0 bits 2147483648 0
// EXTREMES: frame 2: -20.499931 29.499866 -5.124988 1.624995 5.0 bits 2147483648 0

// A buffer emptied, kept to its first rows and given rows alike outside
// the `for`s of a `gpu system`, round by round in a `while`: its count the
// CPU's and the GPU's loops', the rows filled on the GPU, the same.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_buffers.ent > %t.buffers.cpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_buffers.ent --gpu > %t.buffers.gpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_buffers.ent --gpu --parallel > %t.buffers.gpupar
// RUN: diff %t.buffers.cpu %t.buffers.gpu
// RUN: diff %t.buffers.cpu %t.buffers.gpupar
// RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BUFFERS --input-file=%t.buffers.gpu
// BUFFERS: frame 2: 20034 rows, sum 1499849901, first -1 0 49990 1 last -2
// BUFFERS: seen 801580000

// Along relations' edges from both ends, in the shape of the epidemic's
