// Slices of entities `with` and `without` a tag their archetype holds in
// its rows (test/Integration/slice_tags.test), the slices' systems on the
// GPU: of those that have it, or lack it, the same as on the CPU.
// RUN: sed -e 's/^system slice_/gpu system slice_/' %S/Inputs/slice_tags.ent > %t.tags.ent
