// Rows given to buffers from `for`s of a `gpu` system (two archetypes,
// every entity and those under an `if`, two `for`s one after the other
// into one buffer): put in the order of the entities on the GPU, read
// there by the next system, the same as on the CPU.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_given.ent > %t.given.cpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_given.ent --gpu > %t.given.gpu
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/gpu_given.ent --gpu --parallel > %t.given.gpupar
